WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:09.480
Yoo-hoo!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.900
Sch-cool!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.120
Yiee! It's 8:30!

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.620
Kurata Sana, age 11.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:34.210
"I'm an Elementary School Student
With a Pimp"

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.170
How come you didn't wake me up, Mama!?

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:41.180
--Only just five minutes sooner would have
been fine! --A sleeping child grows.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.550
--Why couldn't you call me earlier!?
--A child who sleeps in...

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:47.230
...grows even more. Good morning, Sana.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.940
Oh, she's gone.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.440
"Breakfast with Sana and Mama."

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.530
There, okay!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.200
--Morning, Shimura-san!
--Morning, Sana-chan.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.280
Oh, I'm so late!
Why is this happening?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.540
I'm already late!
Mama, please, take me!

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.080
Whether you sleep in is up to you.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.880
But your mother is not so open-minded...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.420
...as to let you go to school
without breakfast.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.390
I humbly accept...

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:29.560
You don't need to rush so.
Your school isn't going anywhere.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.730
Very good.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.480
Morning, Sana-chan. It's a nice day out.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.480
Whoa! Rei-kun, good morning!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.940
I am desperately, terribly late!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.160
It was already 8:30 when I woke up,
and Mama won't wake me up!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.820
Then she made me sit down
and eat breakfast!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.160
I'll take you there in my car.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.830
Ah! Rei-kun, you're so nice!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.500
I love you! I love you! I love you!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.630
This handsome, sharp-looking man
is my boyfriend and pimp, Rei-kun.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.170
Let's go, Rei-kun. Mama, I'm off!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.510
Drive safely as you rip on out of here!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.720
Oh, by the way, this is Mama.
She's a fairly successful novelist.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.510
She even won the Aoki Laureate Prize.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.600
It's true.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.900
"Rei-kun's Safe Driving"

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.200
Rei-kun, you're going slow! This is
too slow! It would be quicker if I ran!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.530
You're being passed by pedestrians!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.460
I will deliver you to school
reliably and safely, Sana-chan.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.460
That is my job, after all.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:36.500
Rei-kun...!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.500
You're being passed by kindergarteners!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.510
--Yay! I love you!
--Waah! Look out!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.170
Rei-kun, you're just
worried about Sana-chan,

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.170
that's why you're driving safely, huh!?

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.050
You really, really are
my boyfriend, huh?

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.140
Rei-kun, I leave everything
in your hands!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.430
Rei-kun, you just drive as safely
as your heart tells you to!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.010
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.520
Thank you, Rei-kun! We got here safely!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.520
Well, that is my job, after all.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.820
Sana-chan!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.490
About today, you remember that we have a
live broadcast of "Child's Toy," right?

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.530
So, when school lets out,
I'll come pick you up.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.370
Roger!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.500
Okay, okay, perhaps I should
explain some things here.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.210
Ever since Sana-chan was little,
at her mother's suggestion,

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.160
she has been in a theatrical company

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.540
called "Gekidan Komawari,
(The Ensemble Circle),"

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.170
and has been very active
in the entertainment world.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.880
Today, there is a live broadcast
of a show called "Child's Toy,"

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.550
Ah! How long are you going to
kiss him!? Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.550
"Everything was fine up until now..."

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.220
"6th Grade, 3rd Class"

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.810
Everything was fine up until now...

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.140
It's been a little while since I became
a sixth grader, and changed classes.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.690
There's a problem with this class.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.360
See? They're at it now.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:46.490
Stop this! Everyone, put your desks back!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.070
It's time to do arithmetic!
It has already started!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.160
We're already 30 minutes late!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.200
That's it. The boys pick on
the teacher more and more,

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.250
and lately, it's been doing
nothing but escalating.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.840
Ah, she's crying again. But even teachers
that cry so readily are still teachers.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.500
--Ah, Sana-chan!
--Sana-chan!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.840
It's happening again.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.840
The boys are just
getting worse and worse.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.840
It's just our class.
Our lessons aren't getting anywhere.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.510
Hayama Akito...

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.930
He's the one!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:17.730
He started picking on the teacher,
and leads the boys in everything.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.690
He's like the devil.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.190
Where did my desk go?

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.360
Oh, here it is, here it is.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.540
Hey, Hayama Akito-kun,
good morning!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.210
It looks like you must have
eaten something wrong again today,

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.620
which has put you in a bad mood,

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.790
and explains the sullen
look on your face, huh?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.800
Ignore me, will you!?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.340
Anyhow, this desk is mine!
Get your filthy feet off of it!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.800
Come on! Babbit! Babbit!
Move your feet! Come on! Come on!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.300
And while you're at it, tell the
other boys to stop doing this, too!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.810
You're the one who put them up to this--!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.400
Sensei! I have some
questions about the parts

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.820
that I had to leave early for
last time because of work.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.490
Huh? What are they, Sana-chan?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.160
Here, here, you see?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:17.160
It says three parenthesis minus triangle
double-circle X close parenthesis, right?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.160
A pair of cranes slipped on some--

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:24.170
Sensei! My stomach hurts! Sensei! Sensei!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.960
Sensei! Here, here, here!
I don't understand this at all here!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.170
What does this mean exactly?

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.470
Sensei, those guys are obviously faking,
so leave them alone! Come on, come on!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.810
Oh, right.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:39.140
More importantly, here!
I'd like you to teach me this part.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.480
There... there, you see...
There, you see...

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.810
What? What? How do you do it?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.360
--It hurts! It hurts! Away you go!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.780
Boys!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:58.160
Oh, come on now, don't cry.
Don't cry, Mitsuya-sensei.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.160
Sniffle... sniffle...

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.500
Don't sniffle-sniffle, I tell you.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.500
Ah, you moron...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.750
--A-ha-ha! Once we laughed,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.840
--our stomachs feel better!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.840
Cut it out already! We can hear your
noise all the way at the end of the hall!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.680
--Enter Mitsuya-sensei's boyfriend!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.510
--Those two are doin' it!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.850
Mitsuya-sensei, you've got
to keep it together.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.520
But... but...

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.850
How long do you guys think you
can get away with doing this!?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.520
All right! You go, Tanaka-sensei!
You tell them!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.360
Here you are sixth graders,

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.190
and can't even tell the difference
between class time and free time--!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.110
What's wrong, Tanaka-sensei?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.780
What happened to the enthusiasm
you had when you came in here?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.120
What? What is it? Did something happen?

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.450
What's going on? How come?

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.290
What's that self-assured
smile all about?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.750
Does he have something on
the teacher, or something?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.800
--No, I can't take this!
--Wait up! Mitsuya-sensei!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.930
You're the one who needs to wait up!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.470
What's going on here?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.060
What? What?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.520
What is it? What's going on here?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.820
What is this!?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.990
"'Child's Toy' Live Broadcast!!"

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.830
Yuck! Yuck! No! No! No!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.910
Three days ago, and the day before
yesterday, and yesterday, and today,

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:22.830
and tomorrow, and the day after tomorrow,

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.500
and two days from tomorrow,
I'm going to become a stupid student,

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.170
and it's all because of one guy!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.500
And why do the other boys follow him!?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.960
This is the television
studio's makeup room.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.130
Today, we're having a live broadcast
of the popular show "Child's Toy,"

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.800
so all of the children here are nervous.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.800
Not.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.140
He's the devil! Hayama Akito!
He is the devil!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.810
So, Suji-san, is this how my hair
is going to be when I go on today?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.110
Well, Sana-chan, you keep moving.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.150
Ah, Rei-kun! What are you shooting!?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.780
This week's Sana-chan.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:58.450
You know, Sana-chan,
your Manager-sewn has a reputation

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.120
for being a nicer man
than the other actors.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.490
Aah! You're after him!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.160
Sure, if he's a nice man,
I'm taken with him.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.130
You can't put the moves on him.
Rei-kun is my boyfriend and my pimp.

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:12.130
Pimp!? Sana-chan, do you
know what that word means?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:16.840
Sure I know. I make sure to give
him his spending money every month.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.840
Right, Rei-kun?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.220
Huh?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:26.810
That dummy needs to get "ba-bing!"
socked sometime! Ba-bing! Ba-bing!

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:30.860
By "that dummy," you mean
that problem child Hayama-kun?

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:34.440
He's nothing as cutesy as a
"problem child." He's the devil!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.440
Don't do anything rash, Sana-chan.
You're a girl, after all.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.200
It's okay, it's okay!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.450
Using these sword fighting steps
that I learned in Gekidan Komawari...

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.700
...and cut him apart! Cut him apart!
Poke that big dummy like this!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.460
Ah, it's xxxx-chan, from xxxxx!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.130
Sana-chan, I haven't
seen you in a while.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:56.800
Thanks for doing xxxxx's new single,
"xxxxxxx." It's great, huh?

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.760
I'm glad you like it.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.800
Well now, Sana-chan, you're doing
"Child's Toy" live today?

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:01.800
That's right!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.470
Ah, I always watch it.
I'll be pulling for you, okay?

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.390
Thanks, xxxx-chan!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.810
Oops, couldn't help it.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.980
Well then, Sana-chan, see you later.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.610
"Zenjiro's "Child's Toy""

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:22.820
The cherry blossoms are in bloom
for a new school yea-uh!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:23.820
Fantastic!

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:27.160
So how about this new toim? Are you
having a "happy new school yea-uh?"

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.160
What're you, stupid?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.830
Made any "new good friends?"

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.500
Hardly.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.580
And how about your new teach-uhs?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:37.500
Does anyone have any eye-poppingly
good looking teach-uhs?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.170
No one like that here.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:42.510
Isn't that nice? Nothing but new
stuff for awl you youngst-uhs.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.510
No, not "nothing but."

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.680
I shua wish I could be
re-bawn as a kid again.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.510
What are you, stupid?

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.520
Eh, what?

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.850
What's the matt-uh, Sana-chan?
You're in a real fussy mood.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.190
That's right.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.520
Even though it's springtime?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.860
Even though it's springtime.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.860
You aren't having fun this school yea-uh?

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.490
It's the absolute worst.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:04.240
You know what? The world of
a child isn't the sweet life

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.530
that you make it out
to be, Zenjiro-sensei.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.530
Oh no?

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.660
No, it's a "hazardousurvival world,"

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.210
where you either kill,
don't kill, or get killed!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.210
"Hazardousurvival?"

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.420
That's right, "Hazardousurvival!"
It's a "Yakiniku plate" jungle,

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.210
that a soft middle-aged man
like you, Zenjiro-sensei,

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.880
could never hope to survive in!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.880
--Grilled...?
--Yes!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.050
Every single day in our class,

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.550
our teacher's tears flood up
almost to floor level!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.220
During classtime, soccer balls
fly around, rockets fly around,

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.220
and even tigers howl!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.810
Are you listening to me, Zenjiro-sensei?
Are you listening to me, everyone?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.230
That's no school!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:35.600
That is a zoo! And the boys are just
monkeys on Monkey Mountain! Monkeys!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.150
Am I right? Yeah? Am I right?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.150
Every single solitary individual specific
distinct separate last one of them!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.490
And it's him! It's all
his fault! Him! Him!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.820
Who? Who?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:44.820
Him, I tell you!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.160
Who, Ah'm asking you!?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.830
You, Hayama! I mean you!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.370
Are you listening to me, Hayama!?
You stupid monkey,

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.500
Hayama Akito, of the 6th grade,
3rd Class at Shinbo Elementary School!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.500
You! You! It's all your fault!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.840
I rub my sleepy eyes open every
morning and go to school seriously!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.170
If only you weren't there!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.170
If only you weren't there,
the school would be peaceful!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:07.970
Hey! What are you doing!?
Let me go! Let me go! Hayama!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.760
That was a load off!
Right now, I feel like you do

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.430
when you've been all backed up,
and all packed up, and then...

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:32.100
...you poop it all out!
I feel terrific!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:36.010
That was something we hadn't
seen in quite a while, Sana.

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.040
Though your wardrobe was a bit plain.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.480
Still, I hope that this
devil-sent Hayama-kun

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.710
isn't thinking about getting
back at you, Sana-chan.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:49.390
No need to worry! I'm not the
least bit afraid of that brat!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.290
After all, he can't do a
single thing by himself.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.060
He's just a big sissy,
with shriveled-up nards!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.390
Then he might just stir up
the other boys in the class

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.730
and come after you in a group.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.400
Mama...!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:05.070
Mama is just stating the possibility.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.870
At any rate, at your word, the ill
repute of this young boy Hayama

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.410
has now spread to the
far reaches of the land,

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.440
to the millions of people
who were watching television,

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.750
and has been input into their heads.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.750
If this young boy is as much a
devil-sent child as you say he is, Sana,

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.030
then it's only proper that there should
be a proportional retaliation, right?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:28.420
If the worst should happen,
I'll still be around, though.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.760
Rei-kun...!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.300
Ah! I love you, Rei-kun!
If they get back at me,

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.700
you'll break their bones
a million times over,

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.700
and mail them back to them using
business parcel delivery, right?

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.940
--Well now,
I have twelve hours until deadline.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.940
--Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.370
--It's about
time children were going to bed.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.370
--Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.710
Yes, Mama! Rei-kun, let's sleep together!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.710
Sure.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:48.380
Hey, until she graduates
from elementary school,

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.710
don't show her anything
beyond a kiss on the cheek.

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.050
Understood.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.780
"Sana-chan Sings"

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.050
♪ My mood graph goes up and down! ♪

00:14:56.050 --> 00:15:01.050
♪ My mood graph goes up and down!
My mood graph goes up and down! ♪

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.390
♪ I slept in this morning ♪

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.390
♪ Sana is a Sleeping
Ishimatsu of the forest ♪

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.400
♪ When I get to school,
there's Hayama the devil ♪

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.400
♪ He is the worst,
always bothering Sana-chan ♪

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.400
♪ The teacher is crying,
the boys are all wild monkeys ♪

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.070
♪ The classroom is
Hayama's House of Evil! ♪

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:18.410
♪ I had a lot of anger pent up inside ♪

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.410
♪ But I let it all out
on a live "Child's Toy"! ♪

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.410
♪ But I let it all out
on a live "Child's Toy"! ♪

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.410
♪ Now my anger is under control! ♪

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:26.420
♪ Now my anger is under control! ♪

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.420
♪ This is Sana-chan's love song! ♪

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:31.090
Huh? That was a love song?

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.930
Okay, good night.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:03.390
Yoo-hoo!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.520
Sch-cool!

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:09.160
Eh!? I'm late again!?

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.060
Good morning.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.730
You're two minutes faster
than yesterday. Nice job.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:18.400
Sensei, your editor is here.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:19.740
Thank you, Shimura.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.400
Mm, very good.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:25.410
Good morning, Sensei. I've come
to pick up your manuscript.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.720
What? Sensei? Huh? Your manuscript!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.920
Good morning!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.680
Thanks, Rei-kun. Today,
we just barely made it here safe.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:36.690
Sana-chan...

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.020
Eh? What?

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.020
Are you sure you're okay by yourself?
Should I walk you to your classroom?

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.360
Are you worried about me, Rei-kun?

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.030
Uh-huh, sure I am.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.700
I'm all right, I tell you.
If anything should happen,

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.130
I'll use these Cossack Kung Fu Steps
that I learned in Gekidan Komawari

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.700
to go bam-bam!!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.240
I see. Well then,
let me give this to you.

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:58.370
Eh? What's this?

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.040
"Burutcha," The walkie-talkie
that shakes.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.710
Burutcha?

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.410
Now, even if you and I are separated,
Sana-chan, by pushing this switch,

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.720
the device will vibrate,
sending me a signal.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:11.050
Oh? So, this is my
hotline to you, Rei-kun?

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.030
Right. Shall we try it?

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.720
T-this w-works p-pretty g-good!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:16.790
S-so, w-when t-this h-happens,

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.730
I-I'll c-come t-to h-help
y-you r-right a-away.

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.710
T-thanks, R-Rei-kun.
T-these a-are k-kind o-of f-funny.

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:24.140
All that shaking made me short on time!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.070
There you are! Komawari Step!!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.740
Sana-chan, you can't come here!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.740
What's up?

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.080
Sana-chan, you should stay home.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:36.680
The boys who watched TV yesterday said
they were going to clobber you, Sana-chan!

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:41.080
Heh? What a simple hunch to
figure out! You can just relax.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.690
I won't let myself be clobbered
so easily. Nothing to worry about!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:49.020
If anything happens,
Rei-kun gave me this shakey--

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:53.130
Eh? Shakey? Huh?
Shakey? Shakey? Shakey!?

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.370
Ah, that was fun! Thanks, Rei-kun.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:00.700
Aah! I gave it back to Rei-kun!

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:03.040
See you later, Sana-chan!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.040
He didn't notice either,
for some reason...

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.040
Ah! They're here!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.580
Don't get too full
of yourself, Kurata!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:12.720
Why, you! You talked about
Hayama-san on television!

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:15.720
You're a smart-aleck,
just because you're a little bit cute!

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:18.720
Oh? This is a surprise,
you king of the wiseguys!

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.060
What's so wrong with being
a little cute and a smart-aleck?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.060
Look, you...!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:22.730
Run!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.390
But Sana-chan...!

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:27.400
I can't let you all get caught
in the middle of this. Hurry!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.310
We'll go get Tanaka-sensei.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:34.340
If you guys were to see yourselves
in the mirror right now,

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.010
you'd see a bunch of
incredibly barefaced fools!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.670
You guys make monkeys look smart!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.680
What?!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:44.010
Remember this. Folks like you are
called "asses that boar the lion."

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.010
We're what?

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.680
I'm not sure what that means,
but I don't like it!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.350
What she means to say is
"asses that borrow the lion's skin."

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.350
Damn it!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.360
Next time, ask an adult
near you what she means!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.360
--Let her have it!
--Pound her face in!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.690
Pound it in!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.470
Pound it in!?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.580
Ah! It got pounded in! I can't
go on television like this!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.370
Whassis? Sana-chan is absent?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.850
I heard her face got pounded in.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.380
Eeee! Whassat!?

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.380
We're scared!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.710
Then again, a bold change of image could
let Sana bring new life to the show!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.050
The ratings would go up unexpectedly!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.190
Sana-chan's popularity would soar!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.190
In all the excitement,
I'd escape to Hawaii with Rei-kun!

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.390
The sunsets in Hawaii are romantic!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.390
Sana-chan, I love you.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.700
Rei-kun...!

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.000
But then, the press would
find us there, too!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.270
"Mysterious Creature Discovered
with Asian Man in Hawaii"

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:41.110
the article would wrongly say!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.910
The name of Kurata Sana would
ring throughout the world

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.250
as first face-pounded-in entertainer!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.350
Face pounded in!

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.680
Oh, I actually forgot
about the monkeys...!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:56.460
We're really going to pound your face in!

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:58.560
What are you doing?

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:00.860
Hayama-san...!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.690
There you are, Boss Monkey!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.700
She talked about you on
television yesterday, Hayama-san.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.370
Leave the girl alone.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.940
Eh? But...

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.550
Just leave her alone.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:24.920
What was he thinking?

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:29.390
Hayama-san, what do you have in the bag?

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.660
Toys.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.500
Kurata! I'm coming to help right now!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.330
Oh, Kurata!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.670
--You're safe?
--Sana-chan, are you all right?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:46.340
Tanaka-sensei takes a
long time in the bathroom.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.340
Sorry.

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.000
Kurata, are you...?

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.040
I'm fine. Let's go to class.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.540
We sure will!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.010
Stop! Stop that! Stop!

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:00.680
Ha! This is fun!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:03.350
What? What are those?

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:05.020
Water pistols!

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.020
We got them from Hayama-san.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.690
These are great!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:13.300
Hayama-san's idea of using colored ink
instead of water is also very good!

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.370
Stop this! Stop already, you guys!

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.030
Ah, it's starting again.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.370
You guys!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.580
Stop that!

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:30.040
Cut that out, you guys! I can't put up
with any more of this! I'm about to...

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.650
What are you going to do?

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:40.130
What are you going to do, Sensei?

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:46.500
I don't mind going public with this.

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:57.310
I've exposed you adults' true nature.

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:14.590
Cut it out already, would you?

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:41.330
"Back against the wall."

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:46.840
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:51.550
In dire straits,

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:55.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:59.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:04.110
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:10.160
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:12.370
...panic!!

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:18.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.920
he's there.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.170
And our usual classroom...

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:26.800
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:29.260
...for two.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:37.470
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:41.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:45.770
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:51.350
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:54.030
he's there,

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:57.200
And our usual classroom...

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.290
...for two.

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:09.200
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:12.610
I've run out of foursquarence!
Sana, the champion of justice,

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:15.310
will finally, finally step forward!

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:17.450
I'll stop at nothing to take advantage
of whatever weakness he has,

00:24:17.450 --> 00:24:18.810
for the sake of justice!

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:22.020
Oh, Hayama's weakness?
What is it? What is it? What is it?

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:23.990
How do I beat him? How do I beat him?

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:25.990
What should I do, should I do,
should I, should I, Sri Lanka!?

00:24:25.990 --> 00:24:29.860
Next time on Child's Toy, Episode 2 of
the Thrills of Love and Courage Saga:

00:24:29.860 --> 00:24:34.600
"The Whole Classroom
is a Monkey Mountain"

00:24:29.860 --> 00:24:30.660
"The Whole Classroom
is a Monkey Mountain"

00:24:30.660 --> 00:24:32.990
Okay, let's have a fair fight!

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:34.600
What kind of story is this, I wonder?
